window.products.push({"id":1116099,"name":"Arts and Crafts Collection 5′ x 8′ Rug (ATC-1006)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715oi5tlQAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Arts and Crafts period was defined by simple shapes, spare ornamentation and strong lines. Surya's Arts and Crafts Collection is true the spirit of the this design aesthetic featuring patterns with looks similar to the historical movement, inspired by stained glass, painted tiles and stylized floral motifs. Each rug within the Arts and Crafts Collection is hand knotted from 100 percent New Zealand wool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715oi5tlQAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Surya","source_asin":"B004WQP0OE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004WQP0OE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004WQP0OE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
