window.products.push({"id":1116107,"name":"Comfify Set of 3 - Cast Iron Fleur De Lis Double Wall Hooks/Hangers - Decorative Wall Mounted Coat Hook - Rustic Cast Iron - with Screws and Anchors C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k99Ad91uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 3 cast iron wall hooks– Hang your coats, jackets, hats, and more in style with this decorative home organization product. Use these cast iron wall decorative wall hooks your doorway, hallway, living room. Hang your towels and robes in your bathroom. This wall mounted hanger has 2 of hooks. The Fleur De Lis Double Wall Hooks Measure 9.6cm x 10.16cm x 8.89cm wide x 17.1cm high. High quality, solid, heavy-duty product - This iron wall hook is a solid piece, crafted with cast iron from recycled metal. This wall coat rack with hooks is made from recycled iron and treated with special coating, giving the item vintage or rusted look, while protecting the item from rust and wear. Convenient and easy to use - Attractive design of this item does not make it only a decorative piece. It is easy to mount with included screws and anchors. Hanging your coats, towels or other personal items is easy. Thick, rounded hooks will not rip or damage your belongings. Compliment metal wall mounted hanger with other cast iron décor items. Vintage, unique design - Our wall mount hooks can be a great addition to your home décor. This is due to its detailed design which can fit well in your home’s entrance, front door, or wall space. It simply captures the attention of anyone who sees it. They are very attractive and make your storage look very charming. This storage solution the way to wow your guests when they want to hang their clothes, scarves, hats, and coats. Wow yours guests or give this item as a present. Quality and support: We created a great product for you. Our promise to you, our customer, is that you will always be treated fairly and with respect. You will not be disappointed with our industry leading policies and customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k99Ad91uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfify","source_asin":"B012UKTVTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012UKTVTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012UKTVTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
