window.products.push({"id":1116109,"name":"Wisekoti P9 Advanced Automatic Rechargeable, Touchless,Sensor Foaming Soap Dispenser for Kitchen & Bathroom, Foam Dish Soap Dispenser，Support Countert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+31d8DYDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TOUCHLESS DISPENSER】Wisekoti Soap Dispenser Has a Highly Sensitive Infrared Sensor. You Only Need to Put Your Hands Under the Sensing Area and the Intelligent Soap Dispenser Will Automatically Release Foam within 0.25S. Helps in Minimizing Cross Infection Within your Family and Friends Since it’s Touchless or Hands Free. [RECHARGEABLE] Wisekoti Automatic Soap Dispenser No Longer Adopts the Traditional Dry Battery Design and No Trouble of Frequent Battery Replacement. It uses the Upgraded Built-in Rechargeable 1200mA Lithium Battery. It Can Be Used for About 2-3 Months After Charging for 3-5 Hours, and Can Only Be Activated When in Use.The Charging Port is on the Top of the Machine to Avoid Water Ingress and It Adopts Type-C to Avoid the Problem of Wrong Insertion Direction. [GOOD EXPERIENCE] The Ability of One Key Operation Integrates All Functions into One Button, and Each Function Has a Corresponding Led Indicator, Making the Operation Easier.4 Gear Amounts Foam Can Be adjusted.The Bottle with Scale Marks Makes the Mixing of Solutions More Simple.Equipped with Strong Adhesive Pads and Hooks, You Can Place on the Countertop or Mount on the Wall at Will. [SAVES MONEY] The Foam Soap Dispenser is Suitable for Almost All Liquid Soap or Hand Sanitizers Such As Dish Soap, Shower Gel, Detergent, Shampoo and Facial Cleanser Except for Alcoholic and Non-Foaming Liquids. Please Dilute the Raw Water in 1:3 Ratio to Produce High Quality and Dense Foam. 400ml Large Capacity Design Can Be Used More Than 600 Times, and it Can Be Used by a Family for 50-60 Days. Using Our Equipment, You Can Save More Than 50% Soap. This is a Novel Way to Save Money. 【DURABLE】Wisekoti P9 Advanced Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser is Formed by Upgrading and Iterating on Multiple Versions. It Solves the Problems That Dispenser Can't Work Due to Solution Leakage and Pipe Blockage in Most Cases in the Industry. Therefore,It is More Durable.It Can Be Widely Used in Other Places, Such as Kitchen Sink, Bathroom, Hospital, Hotel, Clinic, Pharmacy, Office, Etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+31d8DYDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wisekoti","source_asin":"B0B6HBZ3JK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6HBZ3JK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6HBZ3JK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
