window.products.push({"id":1116172,"name":"Perfect Portions 7-Piece Labelled Color Coded Dishwasher Microwave Safe Diet Portion Control Containers with Meal Planner and Recipe Guide Book","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718tyQ+MkML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Introducing our Perfect Portions portion control 7-piece container set. Designed for perfect balance diet, the Perfect Portion container set is color coded help you classify and organize your diet. Each portion control container is rightly sized and labeled so get right nutrition in right quantity even without measuring. Made from the high-quality plastic material, the Perfect Portions containers are highly durable and can be also used to store food and are compatible with microwave and dishwasher. The package also includes a meal planner and a recipe guidebook to help you lose your weight and have a great shape in just 3 weeks. Perfect Portions Features: 7-PIECE PORTION CONTROL CONTAINER SET: 7- piece portion control container set specially designed to give your body the 7 healthy nutrition components. COLOR CODED: Specifically color-coded containers to help you classify and organize your diet with ease. The 7 color-coded containers include: 1 green veggie container 1 red fruit container 1 orange carb container 1 blue healthy fat container 2 yellow seeds and dressings container PERFECTLY SIZED AND LABELED: Each portion control container set is perfectly sized and labeled so you get the right nutrition in right quantity without even measuring. MICROWAVE/DISHWASHER SAFE: All the containers are dishwasher safe and microwave compatible. FOOD STORAGE: Made from the high-quality plastic material, the Perfect Portions portion control containers can be used to store food. MEAL PLANNER: An interactive meal planner included helping you plan your calorie requirement during activities like a workout, sports etc. RECIPE GUIDE BOOK: A professional recipe guide book included helping you make your favorite breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks and desserts recipe with the right amount of calories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718tyQ+MkML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Portions","source_asin":"B01B6DXZOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B6DXZOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B6DXZOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116173,"name":"HLC.ME Blake Faux Silk 100% Complete Blackout Thermal Insulated Energy Savings Heat/Cold Blocking Short Grommet Curtain Drapery Panels for Bedroom & L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815UqgX+PML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to add a dash of elegance to your living spaces while improving comfort? With these extreme Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME, the beauty is much more than skin deep. Beyond the stunning design and array of fashionable colors, our thermal, insulated curtain panels block out disruptive light and help maintain a comfortable temperature in your home. Light blocking Thermal insulated for heat / cool air retention Premium, Thermal Bond Fabric Beautiful, no-fade solid faux silk Sturdy metal grommets (not plastic) Wide array of colors and sizes available For indoor use only Studies show that light from outside can be detrimental to our sleep and the thin, sheer curtains that are highly popular today aren't much help. These Blake Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME allow you to infuse your home with supreme style while creating a sleep sanctuary in your master bedroom, child's bedroom, or nursery. The secret of our curtain panels is our innovative thermal bond material, which effectively blocks light from shining through (100 Percent of light, in fact). Our blackout curtains are sturdy without being too heavy and bulky and provide a high-end decorative touch. Feel like warm or cool air just goes right out the window (along with your hard-earned money)? HLC.ME Blackout Curtains are the ideal complement to your efforts to conserve energy at home. Each panel features a thin thermal lining woven together into one layer to prevent heat and cold air from entering your home, keeping your living spaces at a comfortable temperature all year long. Machine washable: Dust build-up or stains on your curtains? No need to fret; simply toss the panels into the washing machine on the cold, delicate cycle and use a mild detergent (no bleach). You can even dry them in the dryer on a low setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815UqgX+PML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B08J9DQTZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J9DQTZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J9DQTZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
