window.products.push({"id":1116352,"name":"Power Lift Chair Recliners for Elderly, Electric Fabric Massage Sofa with Heated & Vibration for Home Living Room Up to 330LBS, Lounge Sofa with Massa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xAJ5DKZYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"💺【Skin-friendly & Overstuffed Padding】: We insist on selecting environmentally friendly and non-toxic raw materials to produce each Power Lift Chair. The high-density sponge filled in back cushion and armrest(Overfilled 500g) will provide great support and comfort. The breathable cloth was characterized by skid-proof, wear-resistant, not easy to pilling. 💺【TUV Approved & Silent Motor】: The Lift Chair is equipped with TUV & CE certified motor, which will keep super quiet and great strength support while you lifting or reclining the sofa. The smoothly lifting mechanism will push the chair up to assist the user stand up easily without adding stress to back, waist, or knee. Our Lift chair can be reclined to 150 degrees, just press the 2 button on the right side of the recliner. It's very easy to operate and suitable for any age of people. 💺【Heated Vibration Massage & USB Port】: Our Lift Recliner Chairs have 4 areas of massage( Back, Lumber, Thigh, Shin, totally 8 vibration points), the lumbar area can be heated separately. The 5 modes(Pulse, Press, Wave, Auto, Normal) and 3 intensity will give you unparalleled relaxation after long day work. Don't worry if you accidentally fall asleep on your recliners, as the remote control has 15/30/60 timing button for choice. Extra USB charging outlet will keep your phone charged 💺【Upgraded Structure & Easy to clean 】: The reinforced steel frame will no longer tilt the recliner chair to one side, greatly improved security and extended service life. It's strong enough to withstand 330 LBS weight capacity. Extending footrest provides full stretch and relaxation, It's perfect for reading, sleeping, and napping. High-quality polyester surface is very easy to clean, you can wipe it with a cloth dipped in clean water to get rid of the stains. 💺【Easy Assemble & Guarantee】: Our Electric lift recliners usually need 10-15 mins to finish the installation, no tools required. Clear function and simple operation, even easy to operate for the seniors. They will deliver by 2 boxes with assembly instruction. We promise 1-year warranty for lift motor and steel frame, and free replacement for any shipping damage, defective products, and missing parts. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xAJ5DKZYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YASRKML","source_asin":"B09BKZT76T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BKZT76T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BKZT76T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
