window.products.push({"id":1116382,"name":"Manual Fruit Press Juicer, Heavy Duty Single Press Lemon Squeezer Premium Quality Metal Aluminum Alloy Hand Juicer Fruit Squeezer for Lemon, Orange, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wzMC1WYVL._AC_.jpg","description":"【Ergonomic Design】- The structure of the ergonomic handle helps to save our strength when squeezing. The foot design makes the juicer can be placed on the table easily and stably, and it is not easy to slip. V-shaped juice outlet, convenient for juice. 【Easy to Clean】- The components of this juicer are detachable for easy cleaning. Do not wash in the dishwasher, hand wash, rinse and dry after each use for extended use. 【Multifunctional Manual Juicer】- The manual juicer is not only a lemon juicer, but also suitable for squeezing all kinds of juices, including clementines, oranges, grapefruit, lime and lime juice, as long as it is the fruit you can think of. Just one glass of fresh juice can get enough Vatamin C to meet your daily requirement. 【Ergonomic Handle Design】 – The heavy-duty alloy body of the hand juicer makes your hands never strain, and the foot design of the citrus juicer makes the orange juicer stand on the table easily and stably, Not easy to slip. Ergonomic handle of the manual juicer makes juicing easier and more thorough. 【Easy to Use】- Triangular guide nozzle, anti-drip, easy to use and stable pouring. Make healthy and fresh juice quickly and easily with the Orange Juice Squeezer Make your own fresh orange juice every morning so easy, a breeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wzMC1WYVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BERNIE ANSEL","source_asin":"B0892CGPHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892CGPHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892CGPHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116383,"name":"Euro-Pro EP88SS Silent Super Shark Turbo Handheld Vacuum with Intelli-Sense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":147.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z5ZV4CNTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Reach corners, cracks and crevices other vacuums can't with the 1000-watt Euro-Pro Super Shark hand vac. Featuring more power than some full-size vacuums, the Super Shark has enough suction power to lift 150 lbs. The bagless dirt container has a 25-oz. capacity, and the true HEPA filter traps 99.97% of air impurities. Includes an extra-long deluxe hose, extension tube, deluxe brush with removable bristles, crevice tool/brush and shoulder strap. Amazon.com At 1,000 watts, the Super Shark vacuum is more powerfaul than most other handheld models. It also comes with numerous configurations, for wide-ranging use in the house, car, or workshop, as well as variable suction to accommodate delicate surfaces. The vacuum has a bagless design, gathering debris in a dust cup that is fitted with a washable and reusable filter. The cup detaches from the front of the unit for simple emptying. In addition to the dust-cup filter, the vacuum comes with a pleated true HEPA filter to trap particulates as small as 0.3 microns. The vacuum body features a 1-1/2-inch circular suction opening that is large enough for most small jobs. For bigger tasks, the unit comes with a hose and 6-inch turbo brush. Additional tools--an extension tube, an upholstery brush with removable bristles, and a crevice tool with a flip-up brush--can be used with the hose or fitted onto the suction port directly. The unit also comes with a shoulder strap and a motor-protective thermostat that cuts power in case of overheating. Covered in rugged plastic, the Super Shark body measures 13 by 8 by 5-1/2 inches. No purring kitten, the vacuum does make some noise in use, and tools must be stored separately. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z5ZV4CNTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shark","source_asin":"B000068FH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000068FH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000068FH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116384,"name":"DBNMKK Luxury Fitted Sheet Set with Flat Sheet and 2 Pillowcases, Coral,Breathable Night Sleep Comfort, Deep Pocketed, 4 Piece, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nQK8RMJrL._AC_.jpg","description":"Experience true luxury comfort with a DBNMKK fitted sheet set that comes with all the comfy bedding you’ll need for all-night relaxation. When it’s finally time to settle down at night, you want to curl up in sheets that are soft, breathable, and add just the right touch of luxurious class to your bedding. That’s why we created DBNMKK Fitted Sheet Sets that not only provide cool, relaxed comfort, but come in elegant colors that match your personal style. These premium quality bed sheets offer a high-quality, ultra-soft thread count and a deep-pocketed design that keeps them in place all night long, even if you shift or move. Better yet, they offer moisture-wicking comfort, so you can wake up feeling refreshed, revitalized, and ready to take on the day. Complete with a flat sheet and two pillowcases to add just the right touch of value and comfort to every child, youth, or adult-sized bed, we’ve got luxury sheets and pillowcases you won’t find anywhere else. Product Details: Complete Fitted Sheet Set Complete Fitted Sheet Set Twin, Full, Queen, and King Sizes Twin, Full, Queen, and King Sizes Breathable, Cool Comfort Breathable, Cool Comfort Deep-Pocketed Non-Slip Fit Deep-Pocketed Non-Slip Fit More than 20 Available Color Options More than 20 Available Color Options Machine Washable (Tumble Low) Machine Washable (Tumble Low) Satisfaction Guaranteed Satisfaction Guaranteed Order Includes: Fitted Sheet Fitted Sheet Flat Sheet Flat Sheet Two (2) Pillowcases Two (2) Pillowcases Get a great night’s sleep with true, relaxing comfort by choosing a luxury fitted sheet set from [Brand] by clicking Add to Cart above now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nQK8RMJrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DBNMKK","source_asin":"B07TZ3LMGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZ3LMGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZ3LMGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116385,"name":"Modus Nevis 7 Drawer Double Dresser and Mirror Set in Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1336.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-Ac4YHldL._AC_.jpg","description":"Modus Nevis 7 Drawer Double Dresser in Espresso (included quantity: 1) Deceptively simple in design, the Nevis Dresser is practical and functional. Designed for contemporary living spaces, it has clean lines, stylish brushed chrome accents, gently tapered solid wood posts and recessed side panels to create an urban chic appeal. Its seven spacious drawers will offer plenty of space for your bedroom storage needs.Crafted from Tropical Mahogany solids and a variety of beautiful veneers, the Nevis Collection features solid wood drawer boxes with English dovetail joints on both front and back, full extension ball bearing drawer glides, and corner blocked frames to ensure rigidity, making them as functional as they are sleek. The wide variety of pieces are enhanced by an elaborate American finishing process in either a rich Spice or a deep, dark Espresso, both complimented by brushed chrome hardware. Together with a vast array of contemporary platform, low profile and sleigh bed styles, the Nevis Collection blends the sleek and exotic with the functional.Features :- Dark Espresso finish- Stylish contemporary design- 7 spacious solid wood drawers with English dovetail joinery- Brushed chrome bar pulls contrast beautifully against the dark wood case- Full extension ball bearing drawer glides- Constructed from Tropical Mahogany solid wood and Eastern Ash veneers- Some assembly required.Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 34\" H x 63\" W x 19\" D- Product Weight : 176 lbs.Modus Nevis Landscape Mirror in Espresso (included quantity: 1) The Nevis Landscape Mirror features tapered edges and an understated sleek design that matches other pices of the Nevis Collection. With its dark Espresso finish and contemporary design, it will be the perfect accent piece for any modern bedroom décor. Crafted from Tropical Mahogany solids and a variety of beautiful veneers, the Nevi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-Ac4YHldL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B003AVSFJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003AVSFJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003AVSFJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
