window.products.push({"id":1116409,"name":"Chefast Non-Stick Rolling Pin and Pastry Mat with Silicone Pastry Bags Set: Combo Kit of Tricolor Coupler, Cookie Cutters, Small and Large Silicone Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r76z2iRfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Rolling Pin for Any Occasion We include one traditional and one half-sized rolling pin to give you the precision you need to create tarts, personal pies, and smaller pastries as well as the broad-rolling action that brings a pizza to life. Plus, the 8.5” roller is perfect to get the kids involved! Quick Cookie Cutting Whether it’s stars or hearts, you can create them in a snap with the included stainless steel cookie cutters. It’s the fun, safe, and cool way to bake for your kids or anyone else. Minimize the Mess With the 19.7 x 15.7-inch pastry mat complete with measurements, you don’t need to worry about preventing the dough from sticking. Use this food-grade silicone mat to roll out your favorite concoctions with ease. Enjoy more time baking and less time cleaning up! This 13 pcs accessory kit by Chefast includes everything you need to complement your current decorating tip set, so you’ll always be in full control. We’ve packed our set with 3 reusable pastry bags, 4 different kinds of couplers, and 6 icing bag ties. All of these baking supplies are made to last with the highest quality materials. 3 Reusable Piping Bags For Any Kind Of Decoration As you probably already know, different decorations require different sizes of icing bags. That’s why we included 3 reusable pastry bags in 3 different sizes so you can use the right one for your personal needs. Whether it is a cake, cupcake, cookie, pie, or biscuit decoration, these pastry bags got your covered. Sizes include 12 inches, 14 inches and 16 inches. 4 Handy Couplers With Interchangeable Rings Along with our premium pastry bags, you’ll also find 4 different couplers in this piping kit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r76z2iRfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefast","source_asin":"B08CPRK1B4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CPRK1B4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CPRK1B4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
