window.products.push({"id":1116429,"name":"Gekestory Colorful Cool Mini Humidifier, Aromatherapy Essential Oil Diffusers, Cool Mist Humidifiers, Aroma USB Personal Desktop Humidifier for Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dYKBU6XfL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"✔️EASY TO USE & HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS: One-button control of all functions. Press the button for 1s to control the mist mode. Press for 2s to turn on the colorful night light. Press again for 2s to turn on the gradient 7 colored lights. Made of the same high-grade, safe, and environmentally friendly PP material and is BPA-free. which is safe for your baby and pets. (For the first use, please soak the cotton swab in water for 3-5 minutes, then put it into the catheter) ✔️2 SPRAY MODES & WATERLESS AUTO-OFF: This essential oil diffuser has two mist modes: On continuous mode, it will auto shut off after 4 hours. On intermittent mode, it will auto shut off after 6 hours. It will shut off when the water level is low. Thus, you don't have to worry about the humidifier being damaged in the absence of water. You can use it at night without worrying about safety. ✔️CAR HUMIDIFIER & USB POWER SUPPLY: Portable and small designs are very convenient for you to take with you. The USB power adapter is compatible with any USB port of the device and ensures it can be used in bedrooms, offices, cars, bathrooms or outdoor travel. Perfect high-tech gift idea makes ALL will LOVE it. ✔️ESSENTIAL OIL DIFFUSER FUNCTION: You only need to pour in enough water and a few drops of your favorite essential oils to enjoy the smell of the forest, It can improve breathing and sleep, moisturize dry skin and reduce skin peeling, relieve stress and allergies, reduce electrostatic shocks in dry climates, and promote a natural and healthy lifestyle. ✔️UlTRA-QUIET WORKING: Our air humidifier adopts 26dB low decibel working mode, providing you and your baby with a quiet and comfortable sleeping environment. If you place it on the desktop, you do not even feel it. We have a strong after-sales team, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dYKBU6XfL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gekestory","source_asin":"B0BTZ3XQMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTZ3XQMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTZ3XQMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
