window.products.push({"id":1116645,"name":"Royal Luxury 100% Cotton Flannel Sheet Set, Twin, Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NY7l47u3L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the comfort of this Soft and Cozy Flannel Sheet Set, Flannel fabrics are noted for their fuzzy softness, warmth, and durability, and they can be dyed or printed. Thought to have been popularized in Wales in the 17th century, flannel was an all-wool fabric made of woolen or worsted yarns, with a brushed surface and a soft napped finish obscuring its weave. Flannel may be plain woven or twill woven and, today, most flannel fabrics are made of cotton fibers or synthetic rayon fibers that are slightly napped on both sides to resemble the old woolen or worsted yarn weaves. A wide range of flannel weights and textures is available. The fabric weight and quality of the napping affect the warmth and softness of the fabric. Many people prefer flannel bedding during the cold, winter months, but some flannel weights are appropriate in breathability and comfort all year long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NY7l47u3L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elaine Karen","source_asin":"B00GDC6B5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GDC6B5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GDC6B5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116646,"name":"Poeify Satin Pillowcase for Hair and Skin 2 Pack, Burgundy Silky Pillowcase Queen Set of 2 (20x30 inches), Satin Pillow Cases with Envelope Closure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iQSX60YNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✓ 100% Polyester ✓ Affordable Luxury: Poeify satin pillowcases for hair and skin are made of polyester satin, which provides resilient feel with glossy appearance as soft as silk. Tight stitch and exquisite workmanship can reduce loose threads and maintain long-lasting soft and smooth. Polyester satin fabrics ensure luxurious enjoyment throughout the year at an affordable price. ✓ Deep into a Beauty Sleep: Poeify satin pillow cases create a silky smooth texture with less friction against your hair and skin than cotton pillow covers - Maintain skin moisture all night - Reduce facial fine lines and deep wrinkles - Get rid of hair knots, breakage and dryness - Protect eyelashes from creasing. The soft & smooth satin pillow cases keep you refreshed every morning when you wake up. ✓ Envelope Closure: Poeify satin pillowcase is designed with envelope closure end, which makes it easy to put on and take off. Satin pillowcases with no-zipper provide ample space without slipping or jamming, sleep on a silky satin pillow covers for hair and skin can accompany you through a sweet dream. ✓ Easy Care: Polyester satin fabric is not only hypoallergenic, wrinkle-free, stain & fade resistant, but also more durable than cotton and silk. Care instructions: Machine wash cold, tumble dry low if necessary. ✓ What You Can Get: Burgundy satin pillowcases set of 2 (Excluding pillows) - Queen Size (20x30 inches), fit for both queen and standard size pillows, suitable for guest rooms, bedrooms and sofas. ✓ Risk-Free Shopping: We are full of confidence in quality and believe that you will love the silky satin pillowcases. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us, we offer a full refund guarantee, and our 24-hour customer service team will work with you to make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iQSX60YNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POEIFY","source_asin":"B091YNPQCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091YNPQCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091YNPQCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
