window.products.push({"id":1116733,"name":"Cozolo [2-Panels] Blackout Curtains -Thermal Insulated Grommet Top Room Darkening for Living Room, Set of 2 (Silver, 42 x 63 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWnN9pjuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Includes: Set of 2 Silver blackout grommet curtains, each panel measures 42 Inches the width and 63 Inches the length. Each panel includes 6 silver metal grommet rings, each grommet inner diameter is 1.6 inch, which is compatible with most rods, and slides on easily. Blackout Curtains: Our curtains block out 85- 99% sunlight and UV ray (Dark colors work better). Thermal Insulated: Our triple woven curtains will keep your room insulated from the cold winter and will also protects your furniture, floors, and artwork from the ruins of the sun. Material: 100% Polyester Imported No Fuss Care: Blackout curtains that last amazingly well. Machine washable in cold water, tumble dry. Quick ironing or steam clean when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWnN9pjuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozolo","source_asin":"B08QXTBD27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QXTBD27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QXTBD27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116734,"name":"VEIREN 10 Pieces Stainless Steel Tea Strainers Heart Shaped Tea Infuser Ball with Chain Hook Fine Holes Tea Interval Diffuser Manual Closed Loose Tea ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOn4kGsPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEATURES: Cute infuser to filter out loose tea leaf, herbs and spice. Made of stainless steel, durable and sturdy. Hook design can hang it on the side of the pot or on the side of the cup and pick it up. Easily brew the most flavorful tea with this heart shaped tea infuser SMALL HOLES DESIGN: The surface of the strainer is covered with fine pores to make the water more permeable and good slag effect. A good assistant in the kitchen, can help you filter the tea well. A good choice for afternoon tea and tea party SPECIFICATIONS: 10 pieces Heart Shape Tea Infusers with Chain Hook in silver. Strainer Size: 5 x 4 cm/1.97 x 1.57inch. Chain length: 8.5cm/3.35inch. Total Length:13cm /5.12inch. The tea infuser fits the majority of cups & mugs, easy to use and clean EASY TO USE: Add your favorite tea and drop the infuser into the teapot. Hooks allow the ball to be hung from the teapot or pan handle and can be easily removed when herbs are soaked. You can pull the strainer out of the cup easily with the hook chain APPLICATIONS: Press the heart shapes ball lock to open and put the required materials, put the two balls together, gently buckle the lock to firmly hold. Ideal for spices and loose leaf tea. Brewing the great tea for your friends, families, office or anywhere else","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BOn4kGsPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEIREN","source_asin":"B08YJYJM54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJYJM54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJYJM54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
