window.products.push({"id":1116738,"name":"Nefeeko 32 oz Glass Water Bottles with Straw, Motivational Glass Water Bottle with Time Marker, 1 Liter BPA FREE Leakproof Reusable Glass Water Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717BKUZxY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GLASS WATER BOTTLES WITH TIMES TO DRINK: Nefeeko large glass water bottle was printed inspirational quote, time markers and waterline measurements, to remind and encourage you to drink enough water and achieve your health and fitness goals. Ideal for those who need to track daily water intake during weight loss, fitness or pregnancy. If the hourly water bottle damaged when you received, please promptly contact us for replacement or refund. EQUIPPED WITH 2 LIDS FOR DIFFERENT USE: Our borosilicate glass water bottle are equipped with a natural bamboo lid with straw, and an auto flip lid with handle. You can use the bamboo lid indoor such as office, school and home. The leak proof auto flip lid can be used outdoor such as driving, traveling and fitness. It has a secure lock, making it dust-proof and leak-proof. You can simply open it with one hand by pressing the button after unlocked. THICKENED GLASS - SAFE AND REUSABLE: Our reusable glass water bottle are made of thickened high borosilicate glass, which is fired at a high temperature of 572℉. Its features of high temperature and acid resistance make it less prone to chemical reactions with any liquid. You can safely use the sports glass water bottle for coffee, tea, juice, milk and other beverages. The stylish silicone protective sleeve can also provide non-slip and short falls protection. WIDE MOUTH DESIGN - EASY TO CLEAN & ADD ICE CUBES: The wide mouth design allows you to easily add fruit, ice cubes, sugar cubes and boba pearls, and it's easy to clean by hand or dishwasher. You can also use 32 ounce big water bottle with hydrating reminder as a blender bottle or shaker bottle.【NOTE】The natural bamboo lid can only be washed by hand due to its special material. When not in use, please store it after completely dry for long term use. IDEAL GIFT CHOICE - SUPER VALUE PACK: Our glass tumbler with straw and lid set contains: 1 daily water intake bottle, 1 bamboo lid, 1 auto spout lid, 1 silicone protective sleeve, 1 PETG straw, 1 straw brush and 1 packing box. The aesthetic water bottles is available in a choice of colors, making it a great gift for men or women on Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, back-to-school, birthday and other festivals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717BKUZxY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nefeeko","source_asin":"B09Y8JB6D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8JB6D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8JB6D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
