window.products.push({"id":1116839,"name":"IRIS USA 74 Quart WEATHERPRO Plastic Storage Box with Durable Lid and Seal and Secure Latching Buckles, Weathertight, Black with Red Buckles, 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":107.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c-f2lLjAL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Life is messy and chaotic. Take control from what is closest to you. IRIS USA, with the motto andldquo;Solutions for Everyday Livingandrdquo;, is here to help from start to end. Take IRIS USAandrsquo;s, Proudly Made in USA with global materials, WEATHERTIGHT plastic storage container bin tote organizer with secure lid and buckles in your hands and organize your surroundings. Store your favorite keepsakes and other large valuables in this strong-buckle Weathertight heavy-duty storage tote. The Weathertight storage bin with lids with seal protects contents by keeping air and moisture out. Safely stores many things, such as crafting supplies, camping gear, or clothing in these storage container bins. The grooves in the reinforced lids and body lets you stack the plastic storage container securely in the house, apartment, condo, and in your trucks/cars. Further, the 46.6 quart stackable totes with lids can be placed on top of the 30.6 and 46.6 quart IRIS tote boxes to save space and create a customized storage solution. The 100percent polypropylene plastic container with secure lid is certified by Green Circle, an unbiased third-party organization with a sustainability as their company goal. The manufactured in USA, BPA-Free plastic storage container is a solution tool to organize your pantry/ kitchen as well. Utilize our 16, 26.5, 30, 44, 60, 70, and 26.5 andamp; 44 Quart combo to organize rice, flour, canned goods, spices, seasonings, snacks, pasta, pet food, and etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c-f2lLjAL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IRIS USA, Inc.","source_asin":"B0BCGNTD89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCGNTD89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCGNTD89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
