window.products.push({"id":1116867,"name":"Pizzacraft PC0230 Stovetop Oven Pizza Stone Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714iBEOey+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The stone cleaning brush is essential for the maintenance of the pizza stone inside your pizza oven. Conveniently folds for portability and storage. Ideal for cleaning the oven's baking stones and has a built-in scraper to remove baked-on cheese and toppings. Features comfort grip for easy handling when in use. This brush is recommended for Pizzeria Pronto Stovetop Pizza Oven PC0601 but can also be used with the Pizza craft PizzaQue Outdoor Pizza Oven PC6500, Pizza craft Pizzeria Pronto Outdoor Pizza Oven PC6000 and PizzaQue Deluxe Kettle Grill Pizza Kit for 18\" and 22.5\" Kettle Grills PC7001. HOW TO USE: To open, remove strap and unfold. Use the thumb screw to secure the handle's connection to the brush portion, and tighten to make sure it is solid. The scraper at the end of the brush is ideal for removing cheese and toppings that have baked onto the pizza stone. Use the natural brush bristles to keep the surface of your pizza stone clean, smooth, and free of debris. Make sure that the stone has cooled to room temperature before using the bristles of the brush on your pizza stone. The scraper may be used while the pizza stone is hot and in use. PLEASE NOTE: Do not get wet. Not dishwasher safe. CAUTION: We recommend waiting for your oven and stone to cool before cleaning. Do not leave brush near a heat source.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714iBEOey+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pizzacraft","source_asin":"B01B796T66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B796T66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B796T66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
