window.products.push({"id":1116906,"name":"Marinex 1-2/3-Quart Loaf Pan with Plastic Storage Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41O-8K4zzfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Marinex Glass Bakeware production began over 50 years ago by Santa Marina, the largest glass manufacturer in Latin America. Located in Brazil, Santa Marina has been producing different glass products since 1895. The factory location is close to raw material deposits of boron and sand which is rich in color and quality. During the production process, these raw materials are combined using heat to make borosilicate glass. Borosilicate glass is resistant to changes in temperatures used in cooking and baking. The raw materials also give Marinex glass bakeware a slight bluish tint consistant throughout all pieces. Marinex Glass Bakeware offers several shapes and sizes that have countless uses in culinary activities and are prominent by their beauty, durability, and ease of cleaning. It can be used to prepare, bake, and serve food as well as to freeze prepared food. It is safe for both conventional ovens and microwave ovens. Marinex Bakeware can go from the freezer/refrigerator to a pre-heated oven where the oven temperature does not exceed 100C or 212F to start. However, Marinex Bakeware should not be used on stovetop burners or over a direct flame. This is a 1.6qt. loaf baking dish(10-5/8\" x 5-1/2\" x 2-3/4\") with a plastic lid. Plastic lids vary in color from red, green, yellow, purple, blue, and clear. All Marinex bakeware is dishwasher safe. Item #GD16216010.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41O-8K4zzfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marinex","source_asin":"B0016LQ164","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016LQ164","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016LQ164","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116907,"name":"Pearl Linens Premium 100% Cotton Bath Mats for Bathroom Tub, Bath Mat Towel Hotel 2 Pack, Washable Bath Mats for Bathroom Floor (Not a Bathroom Rug), ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717wGHZex1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton BULK BATH MAT SET: These Bath Mats are made from 100% high-quality terry cotton material which allows them to be extremely absorbent, soft and fluffy. The soft-touch of these luxurious and remarkably soft towels allows you to feel a spa-like atmosphere in the comfort of your home. We at Pearl Linens use 100% genuine quality terry cotton for the manufacturing of soft, luxurious and absorbent. SOFT AND FLUFFY: These Bath Mats are made from 100% terry cotton material which allows them to be extremely durable, lightweight, compact, absorbent, pocket-friendly, soft and fluffy. The soft touch of these luxurious and remarkably soft Bath Mats gives you a spa-like atmosphere in the comfort of your home. These long-lasting bath mats will always protect your feet against the cold and damp floor giving you a luxurious feel at home. WASH CARE INSTRUCTIONS: The mat can be easily machine washed and dried quickly, helping you save time. The colour of the mat remains vibrant even after several years of washing and drying the product. You should not worry about the fibers getting off, the bath mat is really easy to wash and care. Wash the mat with a neutral detergent, and hang to air dry. These bath mats are low maintenance and extremely easy to care for. It is recommended to wash them separately the first time. AN ENVIRONMENT-FRIENDLY GIFTING IDEA: Made from eco-friendly cotton, our towel sets are the best gifting choice for environment lovers. Making our products the perfect gifting idea for all occasions- Christmas, Thanksgiving, Anniversaries, birthdays. Still, looking for a reason to buy? You can always gift it to yourself for a joyous-looking home and bathroom! EXPLORE OUR VIBRANT PRODUCT RANGE: Visit our Amazon brand store for our bath collection on Bath robes, Bath mats, bulk bathroom towel sets & bath sheets. We also offer bulk cleaning products such as Kitchen towels, Dish Cloth, Wash Cloth, Multipurpose towels and Bar Mops. Our collection comes in vibrant colours such as White, Burgundy, Red, Grey, Teal, Navy, Light Blue and Tan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717wGHZex1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pearl Linens","source_asin":"B0BNX7ZDN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNX7ZDN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNX7ZDN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116908,"name":"NOVICA Decorative Mango Wood and Eggshells Mosaic Centerpiece, Beige, The Living Earth'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yKk54eUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Mango wood displays an intricate mosaic that evokes the living earth. Nantana Sompamitre practices the ancient Thai art of eggshell mosaic. The gracefully curving piece is then lacquered according to time honored traditions.  - For decorative use only - Clean with a dry cloth - Do not use abrasives   About our Artist: Nantana Sompamitre learnt her craft from her husband. \"We married when I was 23 years old. We realized that with his skill and mine, we could start our own workshop. He taught me and thanks to my crafting background, I learned quickly. Gradually more shops took an interest in our work and we soon began to sell more. We were very happy as we could see we had a bright future ahead of us. This is what I am proudest of in life. I never dared to dream of a day like this.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yKk54eUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0082HC664","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082HC664","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082HC664","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116909,"name":"CHICVITA Extra Large Cotton Rope Basket Woven Storage Basket with Handles – Natural Laundry Basket Toy Towels Blanket Basket Home Decor Gift, 16\" x 16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DvzcNFHmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color: White mixed Grey Size: 16 x 16 inches HOW TO STAND UP QUICKLY? We can open the package and open the rope basket by hand. Let it stand for a while to let it stretch naturally, or put a few blankets or others inside to make it stand up faster. CARE INSTRUCTIONS? The basket will arrive folded in its package and there will be temporary creases initially. Simply fill the basket full with towels, clothes or blankets and these creases should disappear naturally over time. Another method is to use a steam iron on the cotton rope only to remove the creases quicker. WASHING TIPS It can be placed in a laundry bag or put in a washing machine for cleaning, or manually cleaned with a brush. But rest assured, the hemp basket is more resistant to dirt than rope basket, and can be used for a long time. NOTES: Due to the strong and wear-resistant nature of its natural cotton material, the hardness may not be suitable for clothing such as silk, lace, chiffon and other materials that are too light and thin to avoid scratching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DvzcNFHmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICVITA","source_asin":"B08N11NQN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N11NQN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N11NQN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
