window.products.push({"id":1116994,"name":"Tangkula Sliding Barn Door TV Stand for TV up to 65 Inches, Farmhouse Entertainment Center with Adjustable Storage Shelves, Cable Holes, Media Console","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PHjOdcyDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Our sliding barn door TV stand will be a practical addition in your room! Crafted with the durable thick board, this media console shows great durability. And sliding barn doors strike perfect balance between storage safety and flexibility. Adjustable shelves can accommodate your stuff of different sizes, allowing you to fully utilize the storage space. This TV stand can be also used as a display storage cabinet to help you expand your storage and display your beautiful ornaments in your living room, bedroom and dining room. Feature 59” tabletop can accommodate TV up to 65”5-position adjustable shelves fit items of different sizesSliding barn doors combine storage flexibility with rustic styleAmple storage space keeps items in orderSolid base for higher stability, thick board for better durabilityAnti-toppling fittings for added stability and safetyRear cable management holes make the messy wire invisibleCan be used as TV table, corridor table and side cabinet in living room, bedroom, etc Specification Color: Golden Oak /Grey WashMaterial: MDF, Engineering Wood, SteelOverall Dimension: 59” x16”x 32” (L×W×H) The size of the center cabinet: 25.5‘’ x 14‘’ x27‘’(L x W x H) The size of the shelves on the left and right sides: 15‘’ x 14‘’ x27‘’(L x W x H)Net Weight: 90 lbsTotal Weight Capacity: 132 lbsWeight Capacity of Shelf: 11 lbsPackage Includes: 1x TV Stand1 x User’s Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PHjOdcyDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B09Y1BJ2SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1BJ2SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1BJ2SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1116995,"name":"Extremus Deluge Sports Water Bottle, Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle,Thermos with 100% Leak-Proof Travel Lid, w/Paracord Survival Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGDs+KkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEY FEATURES – Triple insulated vacuum sealed double wall – 100% leak proof – BPA-Free – Paracord Survival handle – Heavy duty 550lb carabiner – Dishwasher safe (SOLID COLORS ONLY) – Available in American born Prym1 patterns TRIPLE-INSULATED – The Extremus Deluge Stainless steel sports bottles have a 3.5mm vacuum space, sealed by double walls of food grade 304 stainless steel with a layer of copper coating to insulate hot or cold beverages from the outer surface. This superior triple-insulated design helps to preserve hot beverages up to 12 hours or cold beverages up to 24 hours. Great as a travel mug! 100% LEAK PROOF BPA-FREE LID – The wide mouth screw on cap with integrated smaller screw on drinking cap is ideal for hot or cold liquids and is 100% leak proof. Our wide mouth water bottle cap provides plenty of access for no-hassle cleaning and the tethered smaller drinking cap means no more lost water bottle caps. The Deluge cap is molded with safe non-toxic BPA-free material for exceptional durability. PARACORD SURVIVAL HANDLE – The Deluge includes a removable survival paracord handle and a heavy duty 550lb carabiner. The Extremus paracord has a tensile strength of 550lbs, making Deluge the ideal sports bottle for not only the gym and everyday use but also unexpected survival situations. DISHWASHER SAFE (SOLID COLORS ONLY) – The Extremus Deluge wide mouth sports bottle is easy to keep clean by hand, and the solid color bottles are also dishwasher safe. Be sure to wash the Deluge before initial use. For a thorough cleaning, remove gasket and seals from the lid and hand wash with a mild dish soap and warm water. Stay hydrated no matter where you go with the Extremus Deluge sports bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGDs+KkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Extremus","source_asin":"B092DNBDVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1116995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DNBDVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092DNBDVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
